      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That \"dried up well\" feeling is a lie your tired mind is telling you—a well can be refilled, but only if you stop trying to force water from dust. You don't have to perform anything; you can just sit in the grey and let it be. The ghost you feel like is just the old self shedding its skin, and that emptiness is the space where something new can finally breathe.",
